      56.86,
      370.59,
      531.41,
      508.7
    ],
    "text": "The Petitioner in this case is challenging the acquisition of lands described as Lot C2 in Plan No.787 A dated 1/06/1973 made by J. Dharmapala, Licensed Surveyor. This application is, in all respects, connected to CA. Application No.962/2007,where an acquisition of a land for the purpose of constructing a Town Hall was challenged, as this application is also seeking the same reliefs that were sought in CA. Application No.962/2007, and, as the facts and circumstances of this case are similar to the circumstances of CA. 962/2007, for the reasons stated in my judgment in CA.962/2007, I dismiss this application without cost.",
